sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff HANDLE_COMPLAINT
    participant UI as Staff Complaints Console
    participant StfCtrl as StaffComplaintsController
    participant CmpSvc as ComplaintService
    participant AuditSvc as AuditLogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Staff,DB: S-05: Staff mo Ho so Trong tai 360 va ban hanh Phan quyet rang buoc (BR-DSP-04)

    Staff->>UI: Mo hang doi /staff/complaints
    UI->>StfCtrl: GET /api/v1/staff/complaints?status=...&includeReportedReviews=true
    StfCtrl->>CmpSvc: GetStaffComplaintQueueAsync(filter)
    CmpSvc->>DB: Query transaction_complaints + dem Open/Investigating/Resolved + ReportedReviews
    StfCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK danh sach cho xu ly & bo dem ton dong

    Staff->>UI: Bam vao 1 phieu de xem Ho so 360 & nhan xu ly
    UI->>StfCtrl: GET /api/v1/staff/complaints/{complaintId}?claim=true
    StfCtrl->>CmpSvc: GetStaffComplaintDossierAsync(staffId, complaintId, claim=true)
    alt Phieu dang Open
        CmpSvc->>DB: UPDATE status = Investigating, assigned_staff_id = staffId
        CmpSvc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("CLAIM_COMPLAINT")
    end
    CmpSvc->>DB: Load HandoverRequest + Items + HandoverReceipt (anh can) + ChatMessages bat bien
    StfCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK StaffComplaintDossierDto (anh R2 2 ben + anh can + chat)

    Staff->>UI: Chon ResolutionOutcome + bien ban >= 10 ky tu + tuy chon canh cao
    UI->>StfCtrl: PATCH /api/v1/staff/complaints/{complaintId}/resolve
    StfCtrl->>CmpSvc: ResolveComplaintAsync(staffId, complaintId, request)
    CmpSvc->>DB: BeginTransaction: Check status != Resolved/Dismissed (else 409)
    alt ResolutionOutcome == CancelDisputedOrder
        CmpSvc->>DB: UPDATE handover_requests = Cancelled
        CmpSvc->>DB: ClawBack GreenPoints tren user_eco_profiles (Math.Max(0, balance - pts) BR-GAM-03)
    else ResolutionOutcome == ConfirmReceiptAsIs hoac CompensateUser
        CmpSvc->>DB: UPDATE handover_requests = Completed + Cong diem chuan neu chua cong
    else ResolutionOutcome == Dismissed
        CmpSvc->>DB: Khoi phuc trang thai don truoc khi tranh chap
    end
    opt issueWarningToRespondent == true
        CmpSvc->>DB: UPDATE users.warning_count += 1 & INSERT account_moderation_logs (RelatedComplaintId)
    end
    CmpSvc->>DB: UPDATE transaction_complaints (Resolved/Dismissed) + SyncHandoverToTradeOrderAsync
    CmpSvc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("RESOLVE_COMPLAINT", oldValues, newValues, resolutionNote)
    AuditSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction
    StfCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK MSG-DSP-02
